  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Gateway Business Advisory Group Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;To support the full mobilisation of the private sector and maximise the impact and effectiveness of Global Gateway investments, an informal Commission expert group called the &lt;strong&gt;Global Gateway Business Advisory Group (BAG)&lt;/strong&gt; was set up and launched on 27&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; September 2023. Through this Commission expert group, the Global Gateway strategy will benefit from the business perspective for its planning and implementation. Consultations with the EU private sector under the BAG on the implementation of the Global Gateway strategy are bringing already interesting elements to the table. In particular in relation to main challenges to ensure a level playing field for EU companies, as well as their strategic feedback on GG priority sectors general trends.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;This Facility will support the work of the BAG and will contribute as a result to attain the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), increasing our partnerships with the private sector and enabling sustainable investments and actions towards sustainable growth and decent job creation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The global objective of this Action is to support the implementation of the GG Business Advisory Group (BAG) and selected priority GG investment projects. The specific objective is to provide technical assistance to INTPA and EU Delegations to increase the participation of the private sector in Global Gateway projects.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
